From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Petr Parkan Janda <petronijus@bastla.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 21:53:20 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] sgx: emulate GL_EXT_unpack_subimage in the GLES2 dispatch
 table

The DDK 1.17 GLES2 library lacks GL_EXT_unpack_subimage, which the
wlroots GLES2 renderer (since 0.13) and weston's gl-renderer (since 10.0)
require. Wrap glPixelStorei, glTexImage2D, glTexSubImage2D, the three
glGet*v and glGetString in the table filled from the DDK: keep
UNPACK_ROW_LENGTH/SKIP_ROWS/SKIP_PIXELS per context, hand the DDK the
selected rows (an offset pointer when they are contiguous, a packed copy
read with alignment 1 otherwise) and advertise the extension.
